{"id":1745012,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-08T11:48:58.621Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1745012,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Sinopsis filem Kolong","overview":"# The Story of Seri  Seri (Luthya Suri) is trapped in debt and forced to flee from two gangsters pursuing her. She returns to her village and attempts to take her mother's land grant to pay off her debts, but her plan is blocked by her younger brother Rudy (Izzy Riff). Rudy orders Seri to work with Hairi (Wan Raja), a blind man living in a bungalow on a hill. At the bungalow, Hairi is accompanied by his personal doctor Dr Umar (Joey Daud) and Citra (Vanessa Angle). Previously, helpers hired by Hairi disappeared mysteriously because they were disturbed by the ghost of his late wife Hanna (Annie Arifin), who died in an accident. Hairi offers a salary of RM 5,000 a month to anyone who can be his helper. Desperate Seri accepts it, even though she feels scared being in the house. Hairi forbids Seri from entering the room below the bungalow. Suspecting that is where Hairi keeps his wealth, Seri conspires with Rudy and Putih (Putih Mamak) to rob Hairi.","popularity":0.0214,"poster_path":null,"production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2019-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Sinopsis filem Kolong","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1280846,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Wan Raja","original_name":"Wan Raja","popularity":0.5726,"profile_path":"/eeezH1xJNTrFWUUtOONSyYFBqU8.jpg","cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a75a9176df11caa1618efa4","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":2383545,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Annie Arifin DFKL","original_name":"Annie Arifin DFK